title Vinyl now playing, 480x480 (draft NowPlaying-480x480): up next, Browse / Queue / Output
sizes 480x480
ppmm 800
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot now-playing
expect esc
expect text "UP NEXT"
expect text "Amerie, 1 Thing (Siik Remix)"
expect text "Browse"
expect text "Vol 60"
expect noquit
